/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\"></use><use data-c=\"53\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-53\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"46\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-46\" transform=\"translate(1334,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(2020,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is a trigonal pyramid.</p>\n<p>Sulphur has a non-bonding pair of electrons and three sulphur-oxygen ( <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"6.664ex\" height=\"2.262ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 2945.4 1000\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"53\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-53\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(778.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(1778.4,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2556.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> bond pairs. <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.339ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"4.006ex\" height=\"1.934ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 1770.6 855\" xmlns:xlink=\"ht